bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    seed_free_fn_byte_len_hijacks_text_byte_len_stage2_scv_cold_init_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28: reproduced with the pinned c6e3ee3c112 Stage 2 candidate (0.5 s) and reduced to native probes built by the pinned seed (byte_len=0 pre-fix, 31 post-fix); workaround tagged at src/os/kernel/loader/byte_utils.spl:49; refusal now names branch and row; status=open pending the seed mangler fix and a full Stage 2 bootstrap."
